fix(cell): retain deadlines and bind installed runtime admission

Carry original discovery and delta budgets through contention and cancellation. Bind the ordinary CPU worker to an independently pinned installed-runtime inventory, explicit v2 owner/worker namespaces, and complete project source closure. Preserve concurrent Growth, readback and CI changes.

Native and Python source-bound receipts are recorded separately; model/expert semantics, device ownership, ordinary multi-Cell FinalUse, independent WAN and paid renewal remain HOLD.